+# Wire serialisation format
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation) as the wire serialisation format. It was chosen for its stronger standardisation and fewer version-compatibility issues, which improves the long-term maintainability and interoperability of the serialisation layer.
